      "uid": "zhcn:b259420d440635d5d79806da",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是的！不过，一直只在脑子胡思乱想的话就什么都开始不了，\n所以我决定现在一步一步地做好自己能做到的事情，踏实地前进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e18823676406b7fb101311b4933f053a6cd18419f5b9abdf9d693c37e5ec32f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
