      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后呢，我在和大家一起跑步的时候突然灵光一闪！\n一个大概和“日本第一的赛马娘”很接近的目标！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f1fd8747019ef68aa1aa5f919fd435058be1ac4c1c92d281586a6f5cc983519",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
